nt"],[["很現代的素食拉麵店，如果沒有訂位的話，需要提前到達排隊，生意很好。很多長輩都來吃。天府麻辣拉麵，可以選擇麵軟，湯底是大量蔬菜湯頭熬製的，所以吃的到很多碎碎的軟蔬菜，雖然個人沒有很喜歡。我特別喜歡小菜的洛神花蕃茄，冰涼開胃，搭配新穎。",null,[0,116]]]],[null,1783564961000000,1783564961000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfc0tXSlR5ZW00WDIySmU1UW1ZRXc4Zw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfc0tXSlR5ZW00WDIySmU1UW1ZRXc4ZxoTQ2d3SW9aVzgwZ1lRaC1PMm5BRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiroanTs9eWAxVtYvUHHf5gK-UQ_2MIrwEoDQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPTmxOcE1IbFNXSEIzVDFSWmQyUXphRWhTTTBwMVpHNVpNbE5JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPTmxOcE1IbFNXSEIzVDFSWmQyUXphRWhTTTBwMVpHNVpNbE5JWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPTmxOcE1IbFNXSEIzVDFSWmQyUXphRWhTTTBwMVpHNVpNbE5JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPTmxOcE1IbFNXSEIzVDFSWmQyUXphRWhTTTBwMVpHNVpNbE5JWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPTmxOcE1IbFNXSEIzVDFSWmQyUXphRWhTTTBwMVpHNVpNbE5JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPTmxOcE1IbFNXSEIzVDFSWmQyUXphRWhTTTBwMVpHNVpNbE5JWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["非常感謝您的支持與肯定！\n期待您下次再來，也歡迎把這份美好的體驗分享給親朋好友喔！",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,4325,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ONlNpMHlSWHB3T1RZd2QzaEhSM0p1ZG5ZMlNIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x193f4425ef85adce!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmN6Si0yRXpwOTYwd3hHR3JudnY2SHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://w